 FullScreen e;rem;add;old;GetWindowLong;SetWindowLong

 ⎕NA'u user32|SetWindowLong* U I U'
 :If 2≠⎕NC'⎕SE.Dyalog.preFullscreenSettings' ⍝ Go Full-screen
     ⎕NA'u user32|GetWindowLong* U I'
     old←GetWindowLong ⎕SE.Handle ¯16
     rem←13303808   ⍝ WS_MAXIMIZEBOX:0x10000 ∨ WS_MINIMIZEBOX:0x20000 ∨ WS_SYSMENU:0x80000 ∨ WS_CAPTION:0xC00000
     add←2147483648 ⍝ WS_POPUP:0x80000000
     ⎕SE.Dyalog.preFullscreenSettings←⎕SE.(State Posn Size),SetWindowLong ⎕SE.Handle ¯16,add+2⊥rem<⍥{⍵⊤⍨32⍴2}old
     ⎕SE.State←2 ⍝ and maximize
     ⎕SE.(mb(cbtop cbbot).(⎕VGET'b'⎕NL ¯9)).Visible←0
     {2 ⎕NQ ⎕SE'CloseSessionItem'⍵}¨'Editor' 'Debugger' 'LanguageBar'
     FSNotify&3
 :Else ⍝ Restore
     {2 ⎕NQ ⎕SE'DockSessionItem'⍵}¨('Editor' '' 12 600 128)('Debugger' '' 9 300 128)('SIstack' 'Debugger' 12 300)('LanguageBar' '' 1 80)
     ⎕SE.(mb(cbtop cbbot).(⍎¨'b'⎕NL ¯9)).Visible←1
     {}SetWindowLong ⎕SE.Handle ¯16,⊢/⎕SE.Dyalog.preFullscreenSettings
     ⎕SE.(State Posn Size)←3↑⎕SE.Dyalog.preFullscreenSettings
     ⎕EX'⎕SE.Dyalog.preFullscreenSettings'
     ⎕SE.cbtop.bandtb5.tb.size.(Thumb←Items⍳Value)
     ⎕NQ ⎕SE'GotFocus'
     ⎕EX'fsnote'
 :EndIf
